    },
    {
      "type": "stage_direction",
      "order": 3,
      "bbox": [
        214,
        191,
        230,
        642
      ],
      "margin_number": null,
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "The student goes away. Strepsiades calls Socrates.",
      "lang": "en",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
      "type": "passage_line",
      "order": 4,
      "bbox": [
        243,
        88,
        258,
        616
      ],
      "margin_number": null,
      "speaker": "STREPSIADES",
      "text": "Socrates! Dear little Socrates! Come here!",
      "lang": "en",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
      "type": "passage_line",
      "order": 5,
      "bbox": [
        263,
        88,
        296,
        722
      ],
      "margin_number": null,
      "speaker": "SOCRATES",
      "text": "Who called? Who forced his way into the thinkery of the\nsophists?",
      "lang": "en",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
      "type": "passage_line",
      "order": 6,
      "bbox": [
        303,
        88,
        336,
        893
      ],
      "margin_number": null,
      "speaker": "SRT.",
      "text": "I shouted, Strepsiades from the deme Kikynna. But I didn't force my way into\nthe thinkery.",
      "lang": "en",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
      "type": "passage_line",
      "order": 7,
      "bbox": [
        342,
        88,
        375,
        781
      ],
      "margin_number": null,
      "speaker": "SOC.",
      "text": "Why call'st thou me, O creature of the day? For what purpose have you\ncome?",
      "lang": "en",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
      "type": "passage_line",
      "order": 8,
      "bbox": [
        381,
        88,
        415,
        908
      ],
      "margin_number": null,
      "speaker": "STR.",
      "text": "I have come as a student into the thinkery. For I have already heard that you are\nwise.",
      "lang": "en",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": []
    },
    {
      "type": "passage_line",
      "order": 9,
      "bbox": [
        421,
        88,
        436,
        715
      ],
      "margin_number": null,
      "speaker": "SOC.",
      "text": "Tell me, who said that? How did you hear that I was wise?",
      "lang": "en",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
      "type": "passage_line",
      "order": 10,
      "bbox": [
        441,
        88,
        456,
        501
      ],
      "margin_number": null,
      "speaker": "STR.",
      "text": "One of the students said this.",
      "lang": "en",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
      "type": "passage_line",
      "order": 11,
      "bbox": [
        461,
        88,
        477,
        513
      ],
      "margin_number": null,
      "speaker": "SOC.",
      "text": "What did the student say? Tell [me].",
      "lang": "en",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
      "type": "passage_line",
      "order": 12,
      "bbox": [
        481,
        88,
        694,
        880
      ],
      "margin_number": null,
      "speaker": "STR.",
      "text": "The student said that a flea bit Chaerephon's eyebrow. Then it jumped onto\nyour head. You asked Chaerephon how many of its own feet the flea leapt.\nYou measured it thus: first you took the flea and put it into warm wax. When\nthe wax became cold, the flea had Persian slippers. Then you measured the\ndistance. I have never seen anything so wise.",
      "lang": "en",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
      "type": "passage_line",
      "order": 13,
      "bbox": [
        700,
        88,
        733,
        842
      ],
      "margin_number": null,
      "speaker": "SOC.",
      "text": "You have never seen anything so wise? But where do you actually come\nfrom?",
      "lang": "en",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
      "type": "passage_line",
      "order": 14,
      "bbox": [
        739,
        88,
        755,
        235
      ],
      "margin_number": null,
      "speaker": "STR.",
      "text": "Kikynna.",
      "lang": "en",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
      "type": "passage_line",
      "order": 15,
      "bbox": [
        759,
        88,
        775,
        715
      ],
      "margin_number": null,
      "speaker": "SOC.",
      "text": "You did not escape my notice being a rustic, and ignorant.",
      "lang": "en",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
      "type": "passage_line",
      "order": 16,
      "bbox": [
        780,
        88,
        813,
        764
      ],
      "margin_number": null,
      "speaker": "STR.",
      "text": "Don't blame me. But tell me, what are you doing in that basket,\nSocrates?",
      "lang": "en",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
      "type": "passage_line",
      "order": 17,
      "bbox": [
        818,
        88,
        835,
        626
      ],
      "margin_number": null,
      "speaker": "SOC.",
      "text": "I am walking on air and contemplating the sun.",
      "lang": "en",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
      "type": "passage_line",
      "order": 18,
      "bbox": [
        840,
        88,
        873,
        891
      ],
      "margin_number": null,
      "speaker": "STR.",
      "text": "Why are you doing that from a basket and not from the ground? What are you\ndiscovering or learning, being in a basket?",
      "lang": "en",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
      "type": "passage_line",
      "order": 19,
      "bbox": [
        879,
        88,
        905,
        888
      ],
      "margin_number": null,
      "speaker": "SOC.",
      "text": "I never discovered meteoric phenomena nor learnt anything, looking from the\nground. For the earth happened to prevent thought.",
      "lang": "en",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    }
  ],
